<title>PORTUGAL: Inapa sells 27 pct Papelaria Fernandes.</title>
<headline>Inapa sells 27 pct Papelaria Fernandes.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Paper company Inapa, Investimentos, Participacoes e Gestao said in a statement that it sold 27 percent of its Papelaria Fernandes unit to Portuguese private investors.</p>
<p>Inapa did not give the value of the deal.</p>
<p>&quot;With this sale, which will be concluded in three weeks, Inapa aims to refocus its activity on its core business -- the production and distribution of paper,&quot; the statement said.</p>
</text>
